  "details": "GNOME Remote Desktop is a remote desktop and screen sharing service for the GNOME desktop environment.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gdm: Missing authorization on CreateRemoteDisplay allows autologin as arbitrary users, including root (CVE-2026-132858)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
